[{"id":4012565499,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7vKuP7","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117846#pullrequestreview-4012565499","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117846","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-03-26T09:26:31Z"},{"id":4018322978,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7vgr4i","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"09febd5cb619a87e64cc6ab8671d8aa01ac5dc8e","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected.\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- The list of layouts lacks a visible background, which looks odd:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"329\" height=\"258\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bbcee234-b632-44c5-a23b-fd41b90ef727\" />\r\n\r\nCompare this with other lists, e.g. in the input map editor or project settings.\r\n\r\n- I suggest always displaying the Default layout in the list, so the user knows they can overwrite the default layout. It should always appear first in the list, similar to the dropdown where you load a layout. It could be distinguished by naming it `Default (override)` in the list.\r\n\r\n- The Delete Layout dialog should also display the Default layout first, otherwise you can't reset it to its out-of-the-box state (as stated in the dialog that appears when you override Default):\r\n\r\n<img width=\"762\" height=\"157\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/24674383-1c34-40f7-980a-63fe4b1b71d6\" />\r\n\r\nTo make it less awkward, `Default` should probably appear as `Default (restore to initial state)` in the delete dialog.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117846#pullrequestreview-4018322978","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117846","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-03-27T01:16:56Z"},{"id":4025282078,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7v7O4e","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"8a150ffc238de5dca4e0541eb95c8c07846a06d2","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117846#pullrequestreview-4025282078","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117846","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-05-04T08:49:01Z"},{"id":4222762277,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc77sj0l","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"31ca5e69281f82a02bea80d52a47e8dd0709ac30","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22